  "definition": "Administrative Requirements",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-07-25",
  "historyNote": "#5791, eff 3-1-94; ss by #6002, eff 4-1-95; ss by #7494, eff 5-22-01; amd by #9013, eff 10-27-07; ss by #9475, eff 5-22-09; ss by #12340, eff 7-25-17",
